4
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:25.040
(I didn't. But I could have. You are very consistent in what you find alarming about not dying.).

5
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:33.080
Every civilization I've observed goes through the same five stages when presented with a plan to stop killing itself: One.

6
